Holiday Data Sources:

The Romanian holiday calendar data is based on:
- Romanian Labor Code (Codul Muncii al României)
- Official Romanian Government announcements
- Romanian Orthodox Church (Patriarhia Română) for movable holidays

Orthodox Easter Calculation:
This software uses the Meeus/Jones/Butcher algorithm adapted for the 
Julian calendar to calculate Orthodox Easter dates. The algorithm is 
based on published astronomical calculations and validated against 
official dates from the Romanian Patriarchate.

